    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunbot Diplomacy: Blast Off</strong> is a prologue to <i>Gunbot Diplomacy.</i>\u00a0You'll have the opportunity to experiment with multiple Bot builds, providing plenty of replayability and a few hours of potential gameplay.<br><br><strong><u>Content available in Blast Off:</u></strong> Two gunbots, eight starting Weapons with plenty of augments and ammo to customize them, 50 Modules + the first ten maps of the game on the base difficulty, featuring 20 unique enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble the perfect arsenal of weapons, from nuclear footballs to fire extinguishers that spray electrified flames. Rewire your Gunbot - frame and (artificial) brain - whether it's for speed, durability, or straight up firepower. Welcome to the wasteland; now pick your flavor of carnage! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/69b97dea230a99d1f140fcc563e078cf.poster.avif?t=1745581168\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/69b97dea230a99d1f140fcc563e078cf.webm?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/69b97dea230a99d1f140fcc563e078cf.mp4?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Infinite replayability!</strong> No two bots are the same, so no two runs are the same! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mix and match from<strong> over 20 base weapons</strong> and customize them to suit your build on a <strong>unique hexagonal upgrade grid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.poster.avif?t=1745581168\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.webm?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.mp4?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose from <strong>more than 80 build-defining modules</strong> - it's not like messing with Gunbot AI lead to the downfall of all human civilization or anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Fast-paced gameplay: let your weapons do the talking and splatter your enemies across the desert, while you dodge out of harm's way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>10 base Gunbots</strong> to choose from, from the gallant <i>LanceBot</i> to the <i>Freezer</i>, the best armed fridge the world has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover hidden combinations for <strong>special evolved weapons</strong> to kick your build into overdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/6d0d55ba9a02097535d994b1f49a526a.avif?t=1745581168\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fun and varied enemies: oozified office workers still on their 9-to-5 grind, brawl boys who just want to fight everything that moves, skittering spine-slinging crab/cactus hybrids, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Special <strong>Hazard and Boss levels</strong> to test your build - and skills - in unique conditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Let your gunbot's automated targeting systems handle the firing - or select which weapons you want to manually aim for optimal control!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunbot Diplomacy: Blast Off</strong> is a prologue to <i>Gunbot Diplomacy.</i>\u00a0You'll have the opportunity to experiment with multiple Bot builds, providing plenty of replayability and a few hours of potential gameplay.<br><br><strong><u>Content available in Blast Off:</u></strong> Two gunbots, eight starting Weapons with plenty of augments and ammo to customize them, 50 Modules + the first ten maps of the game on the base difficulty, featuring 20 unique enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble the perfect arsenal of weapons, from nuclear footballs to fire extinguishers that spray electrified flames. Rewire your Gunbot - frame and (artificial) brain - whether it's for speed, durability, or straight up firepower. Welcome to the wasteland; now pick your flavor of carnage! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/69b97dea230a99d1f140fcc563e078cf.poster.avif?t=1745581168\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/69b97dea230a99d1f140fcc563e078cf.webm?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/69b97dea230a99d1f140fcc563e078cf.mp4?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Infinite replayability!</strong> No two bots are the same, so no two runs are the same! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mix and match from<strong> over 20 base weapons</strong> and customize them to suit your build on a <strong>unique hexagonal upgrade grid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.poster.avif?t=1745581168\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.webm?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/5f1d27cb105e461e056af5cecf7b9438.mp4?t=1745581168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose from <strong>more than 80 build-defining modules</strong> - it's not like messing with Gunbot AI lead to the downfall of all human civilization or anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Fast-paced gameplay: let your weapons do the talking and splatter your enemies across the desert, while you dodge out of harm's way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>10 base Gunbots</strong> to choose from, from the gallant <i>LanceBot</i> to the <i>Freezer</i>, the best armed fridge the world has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover hidden combinations for <strong>special evolved weapons</strong> to kick your build into overdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610940/extras/6d0d55ba9a02097535d994b1f49a526a.avif?t=1745581168\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fun and varied enemies: oozified office workers still on their 9-to-5 grind, brawl boys who just want to fight everything that moves, skittering spine-slinging crab/cactus hybrids, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Special <strong>Hazard and Boss levels</strong> to test your build - and skills - in unique conditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Let your gunbot's automated targeting systems handle the firing - or select which weapons you want to manually aim for optimal control!</p>",
    "short_description": "Splatter slimes, massacre mutants, and assemble your perfect Gunbot! Survive hordes of enemies in this top-down shooter roguelite by customizing your weapons on the unique upgrade grid, and pick from a wide variety of build-defining modules and wacky base bots for a new experience every run.",
